    "description": "Behold, a San Francisco treasure!  This cherished home, passed between only two families in over a century, now awaits its third custodian. Stepping into the living room, you're immediately greeted by tall ceilings, beautiful custom arches and windows that bathe the room in natural light. Reimagined to suit a host's lifestyle, the sizeable dining room awaits your friends and family for gatherings and celebrations. A modern chef's kitchen, complete with a commercial-grade Wolf range and Fisher & Paykel fridge, is the natural gathering place for community and chatter.  With multiple flexible spaces ready for your vision, this home invites creativity.  635 Moscow Street has expertly and gracefully realized much of its potential, yet still offers room to grow --an ideal canvas for the next chapter. Retreat to the inviting backyard, where fresh-grown citrus thrives in the privacy created by the manicured trees. Gaze at the stars while sitting on custom benches that surround your Restoration Hardware fire pit. Revel in a neighborhood that offers every possible amenity - proximity to McLaren Park, Crocker Amazon Playground, schools, shops and eateries. This meticulously cared-for home is awaiting the next generation of memories."
  },
